The BaseName is : C
The Method used here is: Strain-Stress method
The strain mode(s) is(are) specified.
The crystal symmetry is : c1
The order of elastic is : 3
The code for calculating the energy : MATTERSIM
The maximum of the strain : 6.0
The steps run in every mode : 13
The core used in energy calculate : 8

